  prop real_continuous f (within (atreal x) s) --> real_continuous g (within (atreal x) s) --> 0 < f x --> real_continuous (%x1. f x1 ^ g x1) (within (atreal x) s)
  [hint_backward,hint_backward1,hint_forward]

